OL,3,ATrump arrives in Manila for meeting
OL,4,Awith leaders of India, Japan and
OL,5,AAustralia
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump arrives in the Philippines
OL,8,Ffor the first leg of a high-profile
OL,9,Ftrip to Asia - images show the US
OL,10,Fpresident holding flags and a red
OL,11,Fcarpet being rolled out
OL,13,FIn Manila, Trump is due to meet
OL,14,Fregional leaders and America's "Quad"
OL,15,Fsecurity allies - Japan, Australia and
OL,16,FIndia
OL,18,FHe will then fly to Shenzhen on
OL,19,FWednesday to attend a summit of Asia
OL,20,FPacific leaders and have nuclear talks
OL,21,Fwith Chinese President Xi Jinping and
OL,22,FRussia's Vladimir Putin
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
