OL,3,ATrump arrives in Manila for meeting
OL,4,Awith leaders of India, Japan and
OL,5,AAustralia
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Philippines, a key US ally in the
OL,8,Fregion, has prepared a red carpet
OL,9,Fwelcome for Trump, including a state
OL,10,Fluncheon at the presidential palace.
OL,11,FMeanwhile, protests have also been
OL,12,Fplanned
